e zoe kravitz's catwoman who's  clearly some sort of cat burglar and is  not afraid to throw down with the batman  we were also introduced to the highly  anticipated paul danos duct tape  wielding riddler character  who seems to have a major issue with the  batman and looks to be a very central  piece of this film plus we saw colin  farrell in some  serious makeup and transformation as the  penguin along with jeffrey ray as  commissioner gordon  who already seems to be on good working  terms with the batman i'm assuming  they've done a bunch of zoom meetings  together  any of this mean anything to you as far  as robert pattinson's batman well we  pretty much got the trifecta a better  look at the bat suit  seeing the batmobile in action and what  is most likely a first look at the  batcave which by the way looks like the  foyer of a rundown old mansion  and is pretty dope speaking of the suit  reeves confirmed that it's homemade and  bruce is still making adjustments love  it  and the batmobile well it's clearly had  some adjustments made to it as well and  i couldn't be more stoked  check out our ketchup episode on more  details of the batmobile if you haven't  already  also let's take a moment to appreciate  that a batman film is finally  acknowledging that batman clearly wears  black makeup around his eyes when he's  in the suit  i mean that was my favorite part about  george clooney's batman  alright bat fans it is time to back kick  it over to you now and i am done with  the bad puns but please let us know all  your thoughts and feelings in the  comments section and let us know if you  are excited for the batman  also keep an eye out for future episodes  on more dc updates like the snyder cut  the suicide squad  and wonder woman and so much more it's  gonna be so fun  also now is a great time to join our fan  group on facebook right now you can vote  on your favorite rotten movie for an  upcoming ketchup episode  and if you don't want to miss out on any  future